{"role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"tool_0WG4rixKBBAzwj1XDfSZU7br","function":{"name":"Write","arguments":"{\"content\":\"# BL-RELEASE-PREFLIGHT — Kimi supporting preflight (retry1), 2026-10-08\\n\\n- Task: `release-readiness-preflight-76d916b-kimi-r0` (RETRY1, single allowed retry after r0 timed out at 2402s without verdict)\\n- Role: fresh independent Kimi-family **supporting preflight Evaluator** (not Generator), commissioned under harness-rules §1.5 while the parent batch remains `building`\\n- Repo/ref verified: `git rev-parse HEAD` = `76d916ba2e3a7147acda5ac9ef15fa70a9cd9958` (exact match to commissioned `repo.ref`), clean status at `76d916b docs(BL-RELEASE-READINESS): transport isolated F001-F003 candidate`\\n- Scope: local technical prereview of **F001/F002/F003 only**. This is **not** F005 formal full-composition closure and **not** production signoff. `release_ready=false`.\\n- Environment: Node `v22.22.0` via `/Users/yixingzhou/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.0/bin`, fresh `node_modules` (`npm ci --no-audit --no-fund`, exit 0), synthetic `HOME=USERPROFILE=/private/tmp/kimi-preflight-r1-home`, `TMPDIR=/private/tmp/kimi-preflight-r1-tmp`, probe base `/private/tmp/kimi-pf-r1/probes`. No production/SSH host contacted, no credentials read, no Secrets/environments touched, no state-machine files modified, no commit/push.\\n\\n## Verdict summary (details per feature below)\\n\\n| Feature | Preflight result | Own controls |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| F001 macOS native gate composition | PASS (preflight scope) | 5/5 retained + 4/4 additional + focused vitest |\\n| F002 fail-closed predecessor guard | PASS (preflight scope) | 19/19 retained + 9/9 additional + focused vitest |\\n| F003 read-only host inventory | PASS (preflight scope) | 29/29 retained (21 script + 8 transport) + 16/16 additional + focused vitest |\\n\\nAggregate: fresh `npm ci` OK, `npm run verify` (prisma generate + `tsc --noEmit`) exit 0, `npm run lint` exit 0, focused vitest 6 files / **90 tests all passed on first run** (`tests/ci/vps-host-preflight.test.ts`, `tests/server/release-image.test.ts`, `tests/server/release-rehearsal.test.ts`, `tests/ci/macos-launchd-cleanup-trap.test.ts`, `tests/ci/macos-launchd-installer-gate.test.ts`, `tests/cli/service-launchd.test.ts`, 33.9s). Retained r0 probe suites re-executed fresh in this worktree: **53/53 pass**. Evaluator-derived additional probe suite: **29/29 pass** on run3 (run1/run2 initial failures preserved, see below).\\n\\n## Independence statement\\n\\nPrior r0 evidence (`docs/test-reports/BL-RELEASE-READINESS-kimi-preflight-timeout-r0-20261008/` in the original worktree) and all Generator reports were treated as **claims only**. I independently read the spec (including the narrow fixture/null-code adjudications), the actual sources (`scripts/verify-vps-predecessor.sh`, `scripts/deploy-vps-release.sh`, `scripts/ci/vps-host-preflight.sh`, `.github/workflows/deploy-vps.yml`, `src/cli/service.ts`), then (a) re-executed the retained r0 probe scripts as controls in this fresh worktree and (b) authored an additional probe suite (`probes/f-additional-probes.mjs`) covering scenarios the retained set does not (F002: COMPOSE_PROJECT_NAME override, symlinked `.env`/previous-env, manifest/env mismatch, retained-mode negatives, immutable-manifest positive; F003: wrong app/postgres network, wrong volume, image-id mismatch, non-digest running image, health failure, absent postgres, symlinked `.releases`, oversized `.env`, bad ports, path edge cases, root/numeric image users, revision-label variants; transport: extra allowlist mutations, clean-env/byte-bound/artifact statics, inventory-script mutation/redirect scan; F001: fixture-label scope, cleanup-trap statics, extra gate negatives, byte-identity vs `3d0a974` derived directly via `git show`).\\n\\n## F001 — compose macOS native gate (PASS, preflight scope)\\n\\n- All 6 declared imported paths are byte-identical to declared source commit `3d0a974f4916c911917e1b0