+ 16/16 additional): observed `digest_activated` happy path emits only allowlisted keys with hashed file metadata (sha256+mode, never content); legacy source-built serving reports `legacy_or_unknown` and creates no ledger; explicit-null health code refused (`backend_unready`), absent code accepted only with exact SHA; wrong code/commit refused; duplicate/malicious (`$(touch PWNED)` substitution never executed)/symlinked/oversized `.env` refused (`duplicate_setting`/`invalid_setting`/`unsafe_config_file`/`oversized_config_file`); wrong `APP_HOST_PORT` value refused; missing/duplicate/stopped/unhealthy/wrong-project/wrong-service app refused; wrong app/postgres network, wrong volume, env-image vs running-image-id mismatch, non-digest running image refused; absent postgres still observed with `unknown` postgres fields; root and numeric image users mapped; invalid OCI revision label refused, `<no value>` tolerated as `unknown`; hung docker query bounded (~5s) with stderr suppressed; malicious path/SHA arguments refused **before any docker call**; ambient `DOCKER_HOST`/Compose/proxy overrides unset. Stub call logs contain only read-only docker verbs; planted canaries (in `.env`, compose comment, health payload, stub stderr) never appear in stdout/stderr/report; fixture state byte-identical after every run.\\n\\n## Truthful limits of this review\\n\\n- Local synthetic fixtures and statics only: no production/SSH host was contacted, no real Docker daemon exercised, no live launchd load performed on this machine. Native OS service behavior and exact multi-OS CI remain F004 gates.\\n- Broad full unit suite **not** rerun (per commission: focused fresh npmci/typecheck and decisive own controls suffice). The r0 `05-full-unit.log` remains a claim, not my evidence.\\n- Coordinator-provided CI context (Windows failed / Ubuntu/macOS/PG16/browser passed at 76d916b, run 37803611472; OCI/deploy skipped) recorded as claims; not independently re-verified, and not F005 evidence. No production app/DB has changed.\\n- Initial probe-authoring failures preserved, not hidden: additional-suite run1 6/29 exit 1 (relative script paths + two over-broad static regexes — probe bugs, not product drift; `raw/own-f-additional-probes-run1-initial-failures.json`), run2 28/29 (wrong `RUNNER_TEMP` literal assumption; fixture actually scopes via `tmpdir()` prefix, `raw/own-f-additional-probes-run2.json`), run3 29/29 exit 0 (`raw/own-f-additional-probes-run3.json`). All npm/test runs above passed on their first execution.\\n\\n## Open items left untouched (by commission)\\n\\nF004 native exact-SHA CI (incl. the failing Windows leg), F005 formal cross-family acceptance, actual legacy digest + encrypted off-host recovery + `POSTGRES_PASSWORD` provisioning + Agent distribution + original BL-HOMEPAGE-FRESHNESS F005 all remain **open**. `progress.json` / `features.json` / prior evidence unmodified; `current_sprint` stays `BL-RELEASE-READINESS`. No commit performed; Coordinator transports unchanged.\\n\\n## Evidence index (this attempt)\\n\\n- `raw/01-npm-ci-tail.log`, `raw/02-typecheck.log`, `raw/03-focused-vitest-tail.log`, `raw/04-lint.log` — fresh Node22 toolchain runs (all exit 0; logs are the captured tails)\\n- `raw/05-f002-adjudicated-predicate-diff.txt` — bc9→HEAD one-line predicate diff\\n- `raw/retained-f001-macos-probes.json` (5/5), `raw/retained-f002-predecessor-probes.json` (19/19), `raw/retained-f003-host-preflight-probes.json` (21/21), `raw/retained-f003-transport-probes.json` (8/8) — retained r0 controls re-executed fresh here\\n- `raw/own-f-additional-probes-run3.json` (29/29, exit 0) + preserved failures run1/run2 — evaluator-derived additional controls\\n- `probes/` — the exact probe scripts executed (4 retained + 1 additional)\\n- Deliverable verdict: `docs/test-reports/BL-RELEASE-PREFLIGHT-verdict.json` (batch_id `BL-RELEASE-PREFLIGHT`)\\n\",\"path\":\"docs/test-reports/BL-RELEASE-READINESS-kimi-preflight-retry1-20261008/REPORT.md\"}"}}]}
